{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中船防務截至六月底止中期按年多賺近五成九，純利8.36億元人民幣，中期息每10股派1元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入增長百分之9，至1,111億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T23:20:58.654028+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}